ent-HereticMiraculousMirror = miraculous mirror
    .desc = A silvered mirror that shows more than your reflection.
ent-HereticPaintingWeeping = the sister and he who wept
    .desc = A weeping painting that clears the mind of the faithful and curses heathens with visions.
ent-HereticPaintingDesire = the feast of desire
    .desc = A hungry painting that feeds the faithful and starves heathens.
ent-HereticPaintingVines = great chaparral over rolling hills
    .desc = A green painting that slows heathens who linger near it.
ent-HereticPaintingBeauty = lady of the gate
    .desc = A beautiful painting that steals the words of heathens.
ent-HereticPaintingRust = master of the rusted mountain
    .desc = A rusted painting that corrodes the floor heathens walk on.
ent-HereticMansusGate = mansus gate
    .desc = A paired gate to the Mansus. Only the faithful, the dead, or the willing may pass.

ent-HereticSoulBottleEmpty = soul bottle
    .desc = An empty crystalline bottle. Whispers echo from within, promising to capture the essence of the departed.
ent-HereticSoulBottleFull = filled soul bottle
    .desc = A crystalline bottle filled with a swirling, ethereal essence. The whispers within have gone silent.
ent-ArmBladeShattered = shattered arm blade
    .desc = A jagged blade of blue glass fused to the arm. It cannot be removed.
ent-ArmHammerShattered = shattered arm hammer
    .desc = A heavy head of blue glass fused to the arm. It cannot be removed.
ent-HereticEyeMedallion = eye medallion
    .desc = An ornate medallion bearing the sigil of a watchful eye. It seems to stare back at you.
ent-HereticOgBook = tome of forgotten lore
    .desc = An ancient book filled with esoteric knowledge. Its pages seem to writhe when viewed from the corner of your eye.
ent-HereticSpaceHands = mansus hands
    .desc = Ethereal gauntlets that phase in and out of reality. They allow you to grasp what should not be grasped.
ent-MobGhoulMirrorMaid = maid in the mirror
    .desc = A floating and flowing wisp of chilled air. Glancing at it causes it to shimmer slightly.
ent-MobGhoulAshSpirit = ash spirit
    .desc = A manifestation of ash, trailing a perpetual cloud of short-lived cinders.
ent-MobShatteredRisen = shattered risen
    .desc = A corpse dragged back to near-life by a cold, rending force. Its hands are brutal nests of sharp bone-shards.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredTorso = shattered torso
    .desc = A torso of blue glass shot through with a dark, frozen light. It still twitches.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredHead = shattered head
    .desc = A head of blue glass, cracked down the middle, holding a face that is almost a face.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredArmLeft = shattered left arm
    .desc = A long arm of blue glass ending in a nest of blades.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredArmRight = shattered right arm
    .desc = A long arm of blue glass ending in a nest of blades.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredHandLeft = shattered left hand
    .desc = A glass hand, fingers like needles.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredHandRight = shattered right hand
    .desc = A glass hand, fingers like needles.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredLegLeft = shattered left leg
    .desc = A glass leg, still strong enough to hold a body up.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredLegRight = shattered right leg
    .desc = A glass leg, still strong enough to hold a body up.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredFootLeft = shattered left foot
    .desc = A foot of glass, leaving slivers wherever it walks.
ent-HereticOrganShatteredFootRight = shattered right foot
    .desc = A foot of glass, leaving slivers wherever it walks.
ent-MoonConfusedStatusEffect = moon confusion
    .desc = Your senses betray you.
ent-HereticPaleFogMoon = pale fog
    .desc = Something is there...
ent-HereticOgBookBarrier = labyrinth pages
    .desc = A storm of writhing pages. It repels the unfaithful.
heretic-ogbook-empty = The pages refuse to rise. Wait a little longer.
heretic-ogbook-used = The tome snaps open and a wall of pages rises!
heretic-ogbook-repel = The pages hurl you back!
heretic-track-target = It lies {$dir}, {$dist} meters away.
heretic-track-no-target = That one is not bound to your heart.
