heretic-flesh-eat-organ = Your maw hungers, and is filled.
alerts-crucible-active-name = Crucible
    .desc = The crucible is bubbling with ichor.
ent-HereticRaggedSword = ragged sword
    .desc = This blade feels cold and faintly resonant. Its surface swims with impossible, fleeting geometries.
ent-EnvyKnife = envy's knife
    .desc = Their success will be yours.
ent-HereticEldritchCrown = crown of the gibbet
    .desc = A ragged crown. Wearing it, your flesh serves more master than most.
